B.Yg=new A.wZ("Taichi Okawa","Senior Mobile Engineer","Born in Yilan, Taiwan, and acquired Japanese nationality in 2024.\nGraduated from the Department of Computer Science, I began my career in BIOS development for one year before transitioning to App development.","During my seven years at my previous company, I primarily focused on iOS frontend development (Swift / UIKit / SwiftUI), while also contributing to Android (Java / Kotlin) and backend (PHP / Oracle) projects. This experience gave me a solid understanding of end-to-end system architecture and hands-on implementation, and allowed me to develop practical cross-platform design skills.","After leaving my previous role, I began leveraging AI agents (such as Claude Code and Antigravity) in personal Flutter projects, focusing on improving development efficiency and integrating AI into practical workflows.",B.SG,B.Sk)
